{"2231020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chronicles: Medieval", "steam_appid": 2231020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chronicles: Medieval</strong> puts you at the center of a vast medieval sandbox, where the battles you fight, the army you build, and the decisions you make are what shape the course of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is at the heart of it. Hundreds of soldiers clash around you, banners against banners, steel against steel. You command your troops in real time while fighting alongside them, rising from an unknown soldier to someone this era will remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Write your story, make your name!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/7d7cc54f17d646cbdefbdd5db7786d45.poster.avif?t=1787152377\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/7d7cc54f17d646cbdefbdd5db7786d45.webm?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/7d7cc54f17d646cbdefbdd5db7786d45.mp4?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world built from history</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a medieval Europe shaped by the conflicts of the Hundred Years' War. A grounded world that rewards the curious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on technology that makes every landscape feel rich and credible, accompanied by an authentic soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through a turbulent era that never stands still. Factions shift in power, enemy forces patrol the landscape, and unexpected events unfold as you travel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/3b59ec386509f513a37ffd871ed60146.poster.avif?t=1787152377\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/3b59ec386509f513a37ffd871ed60146.webm?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/3b59ec386509f513a37ffd871ed60146.mp4?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense battles await you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of soldiers clash around you. Cavalry hammers into infantry lines. Banners clash, steel meets steel. This is medieval warfare, and you are in the middle of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battles are demanding. Timing, formations, positioning, and the nerve to hold your ground when everything around you is falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Chronicles: Medieval, you are both commander and warrior. In the heat of battle, you issue orders to your troops without ever leaving the fight. Position your Longbowmen at the right distance. Drive your cavalry into a crumbling line. Then draw your sword and enter the fight yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unit fights with purpose. Longbowmen, men-at-arms, crossbowmen, cavalry, and more - each with a distinct role, each responding to your orders in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/c1a750f4582ba6882d2e4e9b168a0a7e.poster.avif?t=1787152377\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/c1a750f4582ba6882d2e4e9b168a0a7e.webm?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/c1a750f4582ba6882d2e4e9b168a0a7e.mp4?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your choices, Your journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval Europe is full of opportunity, and what you do with it is entirely up to you. Where you ride, who you fight, how you build your character and your army are your decisions, so where does your path lead? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice leaves a mark: the banner you raise, the army you build, the battles you pick; all of it shapes your reputation and brings you one step closer to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chronicles: Medieval builds the stage, and you write the story…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/36e5ea112ceb21ec4e9b1505d02048a4.poster.avif?t=1787152377\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/36e5ea112ceb21ec4e9b1505d02048a4.webm?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/36e5ea112ceb21ec4e9b1505d02048a4.mp4?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A game that grows with you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chronicles: Medieval launches into Early Access as the foundation of something larger. The world will deepen, the systems will grow, and the community shapes what comes next. New content, new features, and modding support are part of the road ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/6be0ed1d73f51b4a9b3b4ca503d0e1ee.poster.avif?t=1787152377\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/6be0ed1d73f51b4a9b3b4ca503d0e1ee.webm?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/6be0ed1d73f51b4a9b3b4ca503d0e1ee.mp4?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chronicles: Medieval</strong> puts you at the center of a vast medieval sandbox, where the battles you fight, the army you build, and the decisions you make are what shape the course of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is at the heart of it. Hundreds of soldiers clash around you, banners against banners, steel against steel. You command your troops in real time while fighting alongside them, rising from an unknown soldier to someone this era will remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Write your story, make your name!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/7d7cc54f17d646cbdefbdd5db7786d45.poster.avif?t=1787152377\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/7d7cc54f17d646cbdefbdd5db7786d45.webm?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/7d7cc54f17d646cbdefbdd5db7786d45.mp4?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world built from history</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a medieval Eur