your orders in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/c1a750f4582ba6882d2e4e9b168a0a7e.poster.avif?t=1787152377\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/c1a750f4582ba6882d2e4e9b168a0a7e.webm?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/c1a750f4582ba6882d2e4e9b168a0a7e.mp4?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your choices, Your journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval Europe is full of opportunity, and what you do with it is entirely up to you. Where you ride, who you fight, how you build your character and your army are your decisions, so where does your path lead? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice leaves a mark: the banner you raise, the army you build, the battles you pick; all of it shapes your reputation and brings you one step closer to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chronicles: Medieval builds the stage, and you write the story…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/36e5ea112ceb21ec4e9b1505d02048a4.poster.avif?t=1787152377\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/36e5ea112ceb21ec4e9b1505d02048a4.webm?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/36e5ea112ceb21ec4e9b1505d02048a4.mp4?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A game that grows with you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chronicles: Medieval launches into Early Access as the foundation of something larger. The world will deepen, the systems will grow, and the community shapes what comes next. New content, new features, and modding support are part of the road ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/6be0ed1d73f51b4a9b3b4ca503d0e1ee.poster.avif?t=1787152377\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/6be0ed1d73f51b4a9b3b4ca503d0e1ee.webm?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/extras/6be0ed1d73f51b4a9b3b4ca503d0e1ee.mp4?t=1787152377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Step into a vast, dynamic medieval sandbox set in the age of the Hundred Years' War. Explore a brutal but beautiful, historically grounded Europe, command armies in massive battles, leave a mark the chroniclers can't ignore as you make your name one fight at a time. What story will you write?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Italian, Czech, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/322a3e5e98ce955972508f8ae5a6eb569ee40742/header.jpg?t=1787152377", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/e8865f03b52b75ea36d73148993d0edd32635649/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787152377", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231020/e8865f03b52b75ea36d73148993d0edd32635649/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787152377", "website": "https://www.chronicles.net", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 8700 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB VRAM / AMD RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 60 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700 / AMD Ryzen 7 5800X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 4060 8GB VRAM / AMD RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 60 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© 2026 Raw Power Games ApS. Chronicles: Medieval is a trademark of Archon Games ApS.", "developers": ["Raw Power Games"], "publishers": ["Raw Power Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}, {"id": "70", "description": "Early Access"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnai